  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Fig. 7, ‘Share of countries by the number of years out of the last five years (2020–2024) for which stock data for SDG 3.c.1 occupations are available on the NHWA data platform’ (Source: WHO National Health Workforce Accounts, 2025). A 100% stacked horizontal bar chart across six categories (No year, 1 year, 2 years, 3 years, 4 years, and All 5 years) for Global, WHO regions (AFR, AMR, SEAR, EUR, EMR, WPR), and World Bank income groups (HIC, UMIC, LMIC, LIC). Globally, 25% of countries reported data for all 5 years, 33% for 4 years, 14% for 3 years, 13% for 2 years, 12% for 1 year, and 3% for no year.",
